### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Login as admin to get token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

### Copy the token from the login response and paste it below
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbkBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsInJvbGUiOiJBRE1JTiIsImlzcyI6ImFzc2V0LXRyYWNrZXItYXBpIiwibmFtZSI6IkFkbWluIFVzZXIiLCJleHAiOjE3ODY5MDQ1MjYsImlhdCI6MTc4NjkwMDkyNiwidXNlcklkIjoiNmE4MWQxM2MzNzBkMmJiNzljOGM5YjEwIn0.1lOTKY5vRiWEUElitdYHVvn23XOHcVetzRhOEGKHhls

### 1. GET /api/v1/tickets without token (Expected: 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets

### 2. GET /api/v1/tickets with token (Expected: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. POST /api/v1/tickets with token (Expected: 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Testing V1 Endpoint",
  "description": "Creating a ticket via the new versioned route.",
  "category": "Software",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "createdBy": "admin@example.com"
}

