### Report: tickets grouped by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/tickets-by-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Report: tickets grouped by priority
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/tickets-by-priority
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}